# NZA Sim's own Supabase project (Brief 102). Copy to frontend/.env (gitignored) to turn sign-in on.
# Leave both unset and the app runs exactly as before, with no sign-in.
# Values: Bitwarden org "NZA". Dev project only (NZA Sim (dev), jbjxduathkklruvbmeho) until a prod project exists.
# The anon key is public by design (RLS on every table, writes through security-definer functions).
# Never put a service-role key here or anywhere in the frontend.
VITE_NZASIM_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_NZASIM_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
